          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "शिपाई (śipāī) is a loan from Persian sipāhī, \"soldier\"; in a Marathi office it names the attendant who carries files and tea."
