              "text": "कागदपत्र — kāgadpatra — \"a document; papers\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मीराने सगळी कागदपत्रं एका पिशवीत ठेवली. mīrāne sagḷī kāgadpatraṁ ekā piśvīt ṭhevlī. Meera kept all the papers in one bag."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Neuter. Plural: कागदपत्रं, kāgadpatraṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mostly in the plural, कागदपत्रं, the papers for a task."
            }
          ]
        },
