          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कागदपत्र (kāgadpatra) is a Marathi compound of कागद, \"paper\", a loan from Persian kāghaz, and पत्र, \"a leaf, a letter\", from Sanskrit patra (Monier-Williams)."
            }
